om2
note Contract section 3 lines 76-83: uint/ulong rotr and rotl, constant and public runtime amounts.
note Entry x0 and x2 may hold DATA; n (x1), m (x3) public. No message-dependent address or branch.
note ARM DDI0487M.d C6.2.160 EXTR (p2201), C6.2.349 RORV (p2580), C6.2.295 NEG (p2475).
fn f x uint n uint y ulong m ulong to ulong
a = rotr x 7
r = ulong a
a = rotl x 11
r = xor r ulong a
a = rotr x n
r = xor r ulong a
a = rotl x n
r = xor r ulong a
b = rotr y 17
r = xor r b
b = rotl y 23
r = xor r b
b = rotr y m
r = xor r b
b = rotl y m
ret xor r b
end
